{"3918390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Waking of Haven", "steam_appid": 3918390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick a Hero </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse cast of characters who each have their own unique abilities, factions and playstyles.  When combined with your troops, items and powerups in the Forest, you can create interesting, bizarre and game-breaking synergies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/e7f590388a4a98b7765a19784b62ef56.poster.avif?t=1784516230\" width=492 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/e7f590388a4a98b7765a19784b62ef56.webm?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/e7f590388a4a98b7765a19784b62ef56.mp4?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Squad-Building RTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Waking of Haven is a low-click RTS with action rogue-like elements.  You play as a champion with a unique set of abilities, but ultimately you can only accomplish success by assembling a squad of troops to fight by your side.  These troops can follow simple orders but be careful - they sometimes have a will of their own and will flee if they sense the tide of battle turning against them.  This applies to enemies as well, so use that to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/176824c43e97992aa9221116ad228fca.poster.avif?t=1784516230\" width=518 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/176824c43e97992aa9221116ad228fca.webm?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/176824c43e97992aa9221116ad228fca.mp4?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Venture Forth &amp; Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest itself shifts and changes over time.  Be careful - there’s no way of knowing what dangers - or wonders -might lie in wait for you ahead!  The forest’s inhabitants have not taken kindly to your intrusion and as time passes, the forest becomes more aware of your presence and will send more powerful enemies to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/4be85b87cfdfc364ff48766c683b6bdc.poster.avif?t=1784516230\" width=494 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/4be85b87cfdfc364ff48766c683b6bdc.webm?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/4be85b87cfdfc364ff48766c683b6bdc.mp4?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Haven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haven is a magical place that shelters you - as well as the good peoples of the Forest - from the Watchers.  To keep it hidden from their sight, you must defend the Aether Forge by building fortifications and repelling the swarms of evil creatures who will try to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/24030c8805d1190275af94e30bc37c0c.poster.avif?t=1784516230\" width=488 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/24030c8805d1190275af94e30bc37c0c.webm?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/24030c8805d1190275af94e30bc37c0c.mp4?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day resets your abilities and your squad, allowing you to shape your next build in new and interesting ways.  Invest in Perk Points for your skills, level up your troops, equip them with armaments, and acquire powerful artifacts to exploit the natural synergies between your skills, your forces and your items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/65f321fe450901ed9b085e23d26b8630.poster.avif?t=1784516230\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/65f321fe450901ed9b085e23d26b8630.webm?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/65f321fe450901ed9b085e23d26b8630.mp4?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat the Wathcers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The old man who welcomes you into his Forest - Pan - has given you a quest.  Go forth, explore the forest, gather resources and defend Haven.  Who knows?  In time, you might even become powerful enough to challenge the mighty Watchers and restore the old Sowers who once watched over this kind and ancient land.  But something tells you there's a secret that slumbers at the heart of this forest ... and Haven has something to do with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick a Hero </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse cast of characters who each have their own unique abilities, factions and playstyles.  When combined with your troops, items and powerups in the Forest, you can create interesting, bizarre and game-breaking synergies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/e7f590388a4a98b7765a19784b62ef56.poster.avif?t=1784516230\" width=492 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/e7f590388a4a98b7765a19784b62ef56.webm?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/e7f590388a4a98b7765a19784b62ef56.mp4?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Squad-Building RTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Waking of Haven is a low-click RTS with action rogue-like elements.  You play as a champion with a unique set of abilities, but ultimately you can only accomplish success by assembling a squad of troops to fight by your side.  These troops can follow simple orders but be careful - they sometimes have a will of their own and will flee if they sense the tide of battle turning against them.  This applies to enemies as well, so use that to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/176824c43e97992aa9221116ad228fca.poster.avif?t=1784516230\" width=518 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/176824c43e97992aa9221116ad228fca.webm?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/176824c43e97992aa9221116ad228fca.mp4?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Venture Forth &amp; Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest itself shifts and changes over time.  Be careful - there’s no way of knowing what dangers - or wonders -might lie in wait for you ahead!  The forest’s inhabitants have not taken kindly to your intrusion and as time passes, the forest becomes more aware of your presence and will send more powerful enemies to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/4be85b87cfdfc364ff48766c683b6bdc.poster.avif?t=1784516230\" width=494 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/4be85b87cfdfc364ff48766c683b6bdc.webm?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/4be85b87cfdfc364ff48766c683b6bdc.mp4?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Haven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haven is a magical place that shelters you - as well as the good peoples of the Forest - from the Watchers.  To keep it hidden from their sight, you must defend the Aether Forge by building fortifications and repelling the swarms of evil creatures who will try to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/24030c8805d1190275af94e30bc37c0c.poster.avif?t=1784516230\" width=488 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/24030c8805d1190275af94e30bc37c0c.webm?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/24030c8805d1190275af94e30bc37c0c.mp4?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day resets your abilities and your squad, allowing you to shape your next build in new and interesting ways.  Invest in Perk Points for your skills, level up your troops, equip them with armaments, and acquire powerful artifacts to exploit the natural synergies between your skills, your forces and your items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/65f321fe450901ed9b085e23d26b8630.poster.avif?t=1784516230\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/65f321fe450901ed9b085e23d26b8630.webm?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/65f321fe450901ed9b085e23d26b8630.mp4?t=1784516230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat the Wathcers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The old man who welcomes you into his Forest - Pan - has given you a quest.  Go forth, explore the forest, gather resources and defend Haven.  Who knows?  In time, you might even become powerful enough to challenge the mighty Watchers and restore the old Sowers who once watched over this kind and ancient land.  But something tells you there's a secret that slumbers at the heart of this forest ... and Haven has something to do with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The Waking of Haven is an action RTS squad-builder with roguelike elements. Assume control of a champion lost in an enchanted forest, accompanied by a party of loyal troops. Find resources, level up, upgrade your forces and fight through the ever-shifting pathways of the forest … or die trying.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/94350321d897f3f5053ff6a05495626cdd4648ec/header.jpg?t=1784516230", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/875063348eafa605bbf8862e830ca0c036719214/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784516230", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/875063348eafa605bbf8862e830ca0c036719214/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784516230", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD A8-7600 / Intel® Core™ i3-3210<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 460 / NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 950 / Intel® Iris® Xe Graphics G7<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD A8-7600 / Intel® Core™ i3-3210<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 460 / NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 950 / Intel® Iris® Xe Graphics G7<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Theogeny Games LLC"],